===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*dʰer-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|trone}}, from {{der|en|fro|trone}}, from {{der|en|la|thronus}}, from {{der|en|grc|θρόνος|t=chair, throne}}. Superseded earlier {{m|en|seld|t=seat, throne}}.

